// Task - SL4_TheFamily_Errand1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1662215603" "I've been hearing a lot of complaints about the Family lately. It seems those thugs think they can bully any business owner in town. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want you to hit the streets and show the Family that extortion isn't welcome in this town.</a>"
// AcceptString :
"P3329047471" "Show the Family that extortion isn't welcome"
// SendOffString :
"P2542434743" "The Family has controlled the businesses in Independence Port for some time. I'd suggest starting your sweep around there."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P310876424" "Combat Family menace"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2005847986" "I'm still hearing reports of high pressure tactics from the Family. I need you to show them the error of their ways."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1120276855" "You have discouraged the Family from bullying the business owners of Paragon City."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3824567005" "The Family may think they run things in this town, but they are sorely mistaken. Thanks for making that clear."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL4_TheFamily_Errand2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2059687086" "I guess you've heard that a Family captain, Johnnie Two Shoes, is being tried tomorrow for murder and conspiracy? Well, I can assure you the thugs over in Independence Port are aware of it! They've been protesting by wreaking havoc on city property. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Someone's got to get over to Independence Port and stop the Family protests.</a>  Can you do it?"
// AcceptString :
"P3399526858" "Go to Independence Port and stop the Family protests"
// SendOffString :
"P374898691" "Tempers are particularly high in Wave Landing and Crey Cove. I recommend starting in one of those neighborhoods."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P703496959" "Fight Family in Independence Port"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P820514621" "The Family is still protesting the trial of Johnnie Two Shoes. Somebody has to stop it before the destruction gets out of hand."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P319335278" "You have discouraged the Family from protesting the trial of Johnnie Two Shoes."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3458753234" "The Family hates to see one of their men put in jail. Thanks for keeping them from taking it out on the city, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL4_TheFamily_Errand3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2961295631" "It seems Independence Port is at the center of the Family's Superadine ring. {HeroName}, I want to bust that ring wide open! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Get over to Independence Port and show the Family that they don't run the docks.</a>"
// AcceptString :
"P560418270" "Go to Independence Port and show the Family they don't own the docks"
// SendOffString :
"P801451861" "Bell Point and Patriot Wharf are hotbeds for drug runners. You might want to start in one of those areas."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P396589516" "The Family is still moving drugs through Independence Port. I want it stopped, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2447835894" "You have discouraged the Family from selling drugs in Independence Port."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P531951151" "The Family is at the very heart of the Superadine trade. If we can stop them, we may win Paragon City's war on drugs."
